{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 15,
  "name": "地山谦",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02113",
              "text": "谦。亨，君子有终。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02113",
                "bodyParagraph": 2049
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02114",
              "text": "象曰：地中有山，谦。君子以裒多益寡，称物平施。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02114",
                "bodyParagraph": 2050
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02116",
              "text": "谦卦：通泰。筮遇此卦，君子将有所成就。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02116",
                "bodyParagraph": 2052
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02117",
              "text": "《象辞》说：本卦外卦为坤为地，内卦为艮为山，地中有山，内高外卑，居高不傲，这是谦卦的卦象。君子观此卦象，以谦让为怀，裁取多余的，增益缺乏的，衡量财物的多寡而公平施予。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02117",
                "bodyParagraph": 2053
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0027"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "《断易天机》解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02119",
              "text": "谦卦坤上艮下，为兑宫五世卦。谦为谦逊，内卦艮和外卦坤都是谦虚之象，所以为吉利之卦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02119",
                "bodyParagraph": 2055
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02121",
              "text": "谦和忍让，尊人自卑；利用谦虚，万事可达。 得此卦者，吉利平安，步步高升。谦虚忍让者前途大好，骄横者必招败。谦受益，满招损。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02121",
                "bodyParagraph": 2057
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02123",
              "text": "时运：眼前平顺，步步高升。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02123",
                "bodyParagraph": 2059
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02124",
              "text": "财运：物价合理，利益保障。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02124",
                "bodyParagraph": 2060
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02125",
              "text": "家宅：近山之居，合家平安。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02125",
                "bodyParagraph": 2061
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02126",
              "text": "身体：内郁之症，放宽心胸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02126",
                "bodyParagraph": 2062
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "传统解卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02128",
              "text": "这个卦是异卦（下艮上坤）相叠，艮为山，坤为地。地面有山，地卑（低）而山高，是为内高外低，比喻功高不自居，名高不自誉，位高不自傲。这就是谦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02128",
                "bodyParagraph": 2064
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02129",
              "text": "大象：山应在地面上，而今在地下，代表谦逊之德。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02129",
                "bodyParagraph": 2065
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02130",
              "text": "运势：吉利平安，前途无限，但必须去除骄横之气。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02130",
                "bodyParagraph": 2066
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02131",
              "text": "事业：尚未被人器重，但因品德高尚，终会为人发现。自己不必有意表现，尤其不可放弃谦虚的美德，埋头苦干，一定会得到他人的帮助，在事业上大有作为。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02131",
                "bodyParagraph": 2067
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02132",
              "text": "经商：较为顺利，但不会获暴利，须逐步积累，故应极其小心谨慎，诚心与他人合作，遵守商业道德，通过自己的勤劳努力，取得商业的发展。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02132",
                "bodyParagraph": 2068
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02133",
              "text": "求名：天资聪明，但因性格不善于表现自己，起初往往被埋没，自己只要不灰心，继续努力钻研业务，保持谦逊好学精神，更大的成功正在未来。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02133",
                "bodyParagraph": 2069
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02134",
              "text": "婚恋：美满的婚姻应由双方共同去努力争取。否则，恋爱不成功，家庭不能和睦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02134",
                "bodyParagraph": 2070
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02135",
              "text": "决策：具有内高外低的谦虚美德，善于团结他人，也能得到别人的帮助，事业很顺利，遇到困难，很快可以化险为夷，有惊无险。由于能够认真吸取别人的长处，进步很快，会畅通无阻，但需要特别注意学业、德业和修养。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02135",
                "bodyParagraph": 2071
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02137",
              "text": "谦卦坤上艮下，山居地中，内高而外卑，象征有才德而不自夸。《象》曰“地中有山，谦；君子以裒多益寡，称物平施”。原网页本节混入了《大有卦》的火天之象，已删除错贴的段落，以免误导。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02137",
                "bodyParagraph": 2073
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02140",
              "text": "初六。谦谦君子，用涉大川，吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02140",
                "bodyParagraph": 2076
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02141",
              "text": "象曰：谦谦君子，卑以自牧也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02141",
                "bodyParagraph": 2077
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02143",
              "text": "初六：谦让，再谦让，这才是君子的风度。具有这种品德，即使冒险涉水过河，也是吉利的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02143",
                "bodyParagraph": 2079
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02144",
              "text": "《象辞》说：十分谦让的君子，就是从谦让入手进行自我修养。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02144",
                "bodyParagraph": 2080
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02146",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，宜远行或出游，出外做生意会发财。做官的须退守，不宜与人争利，出差的机会会多。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02146",
                "bodyParagraph": 2082
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02148",
              "text": "时运：不与人争，自可无难。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02148",
                "bodyParagraph": 2084
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02149",
              "text": "财运：投资航业，有利可图。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02149",
                "bodyParagraph": 2085
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02150",
              "text": "家宅：治家以德，平安和睦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02150",
                "bodyParagraph": 2086
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02151",
              "text": "身体：游泳健身。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02151",
                "bodyParagraph": 2087
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02153",
              "text": "初六爻动变得周易第36卦：地火明夷。这个卦是异卦（下离上坤）相叠。离为明，坤为顺；离为日；坤为地。日没入地，光明受损，前途不明，环境困难，宜遵时养晦，坚守正道，外愚内慧，韬光养晦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02153",
                "bodyParagraph": 2089
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "六二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02160",
              "text": "六二。鸣谦，贞吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02160",
                "bodyParagraph": 2096
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02161",
              "text": "象曰：鸣谦贞吉，中心得也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02161",
                "bodyParagraph": 2097
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02163",
              "text": "六二：明智而谦让，卜问得吉兆。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02163",
                "bodyParagraph": 2099
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02164",
              "text": "《象辞》说：明智而谦让，心正而吉利，因为六二之爻居下卦中位，像人守中正之道。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02164",
                "bodyParagraph": 2100
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02166",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，不宜轻举妄动，宜退守。做官的会升迁，读书人会进取成名。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02166",
                "bodyParagraph": 2102
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02168",
              "text": "时运：声名传开，颇为得意。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02168",
                "bodyParagraph": 2104
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02169",
              "text": "财运：得人呼应，利益自来。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02169",
                "bodyParagraph": 2105
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02170",
              "text": "家宅：家有恒产，亦有善名。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02170",
                "bodyParagraph": 2106
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02171",
              "text": "身体：用心过劳之症。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02171",
                "bodyParagraph": 2107
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02173",
              "text": "六二爻动变得周易第46卦：地风升。这个卦是异卦（下巽上坤）相叠。坤为地、为顺；巽为木、为逊。大地生长树木，逐渐成长，日渐高大成材，喻事业步步高升，前程远大，故名“升”。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02173",
                "bodyParagraph": 2109
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "九三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02179",
              "text": "九三。劳谦君子，有终吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02179",
                "bodyParagraph": 2115
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02180",
              "text": "象曰：劳谦君子，万民服也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02180",
                "bodyParagraph": 2116
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02182",
              "text": "九三：勤劳而谦让，这样的人将有好结果，凡事吉利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02182",
                "bodyParagraph": 2118
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02183",
              "text": "《象辞》说：勤劳而谦让的君子，万民敬服。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02183",
                "bodyParagraph": 2119
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02185",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，营谋得利，但会劳心劳力。做官的会高升。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02185",
                "bodyParagraph": 2121
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02187",
              "text": "时运：劳苦有成，晚运亨通。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02187",
                "bodyParagraph": 2123
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02188",
              "text": "财运：基业已成，永保利益。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02188",
                "bodyParagraph": 2124
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02189",
              "text": "家宅：持盈保泰，安居乐业。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02189",
                "bodyParagraph": 2125
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02190",
              "text": "身体：劳累过度，可能归天。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02190",
                "bodyParagraph": 2126
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02192",
              "text": "九三爻动变得周易第2卦：坤为地。这个卦是同卦（下坤上坤）相叠，阴性。象征地（与乾卦相反），顺从天，承载万物，伸展无穷无尽。坤卦以雌马为象征，表明地道生育抚养万物，而又依天顺时，性情温顺。它以“先迷后得”证明“坤”顺从“乾”，依随“乾”，才能把握正确方向，遵循正道，获取吉利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02192",
                "bodyParagraph": 2128
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "六四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02198",
              "text": "六四。无不利，撝谦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02198",
                "bodyParagraph": 2134
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02199",
              "text": "象曰：无不利，撝谦，不违则也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02199",
                "bodyParagraph": 2135
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02201",
              "text": "六四：无所不利，只要奋勇直前而又谦虚谨慎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02201",
                "bodyParagraph": 2137
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02202",
              "text": "《象辞》说：无所不利，只要奋勇直前而又谦虚谨慎，因为这样才不会违犯法则。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02202",
                "bodyParagraph": 2138
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02204",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，无所不通，但做官的、读书人及商人宜固守退让，太盛则有过。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02204",
                "bodyParagraph": 2140
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02206",
              "text": "时运：正当好运，诸事皆吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02206",
                "bodyParagraph": 2142
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02207",
              "text": "财运：利益甚多，留些余地。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02207",
                "bodyParagraph": 2143
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02208",
              "text": "家宅：谦和相处，自无不利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02208",
                "bodyParagraph": 2144
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02209",
              "text": "身体：多多散心，自可痊愈。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02209",
                "bodyParagraph": 2145
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02211",
              "text": "六四爻动变得周易第62卦：雷山小过。这个卦是异卦（下艮上震）相叠。艮为山，震为雷，过山雷鸣，不可不畏惧。阳为大，阴为小，卦外四阴超过中二阳，故称“小过”，小有越过。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02211",
                "bodyParagraph": 2147
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "六五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02218",
              "text": "六五。不富以其邻，利用侵伐，无不利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02218",
                "bodyParagraph": 2154
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02219",
              "text": "象曰：利用侵伐，征不服也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02219",
                "bodyParagraph": 2155
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02221",
              "text": "六五：贫穷是由于敌国的侵掠，应该对之讨伐，无所不利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02221",
                "bodyParagraph": 2157
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02222",
              "text": "《象辞》说：筮遇此爻有利于征战讨伐，因为是征讨不服从王命的人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02222",
                "bodyParagraph": 2158
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02224",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，会得到贵人的帮助而成事，会获得利益，但须谨防生出祸端，与人争诉。当官的会文武兼用，利于进取。读书人会有金榜题名之机会。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02224",
                "bodyParagraph": 2160
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02226",
              "text": "时运：振作自强，不可姑息。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02226",
                "bodyParagraph": 2162
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02227",
              "text": "财运：防人分取，更生事端。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02227",
                "bodyParagraph": 2163
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02228",
              "text": "家宅：择邻而处，守望相助；近邻议婚。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02228",
                "bodyParagraph": 2164
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02229",
              "text": "身体：消热去火。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02229",
                "bodyParagraph": 2165
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02231",
              "text": "六五爻动变得周易第39卦：水山蹇。这个卦是异卦（下艮上坎）相叠。坎为水，艮为山。山高水深，困难重重，人生险阻，见险而止，明哲保身，可谓智慧。蹇，跋行艰难。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02231",
                "bodyParagraph": 2167
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02237",
              "text": "上六。鸣谦，利用行师，征邑国。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02237",
                "bodyParagraph": 2173
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02238",
              "text": "象曰：鸣谦，志未得也；可用行师，征邑国也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02238",
                "bodyParagraph": 2174
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02240",
              "text": "上六：明智而谦让，出兵征伐邑国自然获胜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02240",
                "bodyParagraph": 2176
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02241",
              "text": "《象辞》说：明智而谦让，尚不能感化邑国得行其志，就可以出兵征讨邑国。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02241",
                "bodyParagraph": 2177
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02243",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，有争诉之扰，但会不辨自明。做官的须修德养身，进取有望。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02243",
                "bodyParagraph": 2179
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02245",
              "text": "时运：大运已过，心意受阻。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02245",
                "bodyParagraph": 2181
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02246",
              "text": "财运：有名无实，认真整顿。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02246",
                "bodyParagraph": 2182
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02247",
              "text": "家宅：防范邪祟。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02247",
                "bodyParagraph": 2183
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-02248",
              "text": "身体：调养心志。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02248",
                "bodyParagraph": 2184
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-02250",
              "text": "上六爻动变得周易第52卦：艮为山。这个卦是同卦（下艮上艮）相叠。艮为山，二山相重，喻静止。它和震卦相反。高潮过后，必然出现低潮，进入事物的相对静止阶段。静止如山，宜止则止，宜行则行。行止即动和静，都不可失机，应恰到好处，动静得宜，适可而止。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-02250",
                "bodyParagraph": 2186
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 14
}
